---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Doru Stoica — #DEPPSiT</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Creator de conținut despre suveranitate digitală, self-hosting și AI local. Dacă eu pot, poți și tu." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
</head>
<body class="bg-[#0a0a0f] text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-16 font-sans">

  <main class="w-full max-w-lg flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-8">

    <!-- Avatar -->
    <img
      src="/doru.jpg"
      alt="Doru Stoica"
      class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full object-cover object-top shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 border-2 border-emerald-500/30"
    />

    <!-- Nume + tagline -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Doru Stoica</h1>
      <p class="text-emerald-400 font-medium tracking-wide text-sm uppercase">#DEPPSiT — Dacă eu pot, poți și tu</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio -->
    <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
      Nu am urmat un drum drept. De la electrician naval la electrical engineer și acum software engineer.
      Calea a fost plină de obstacole și încercări, dar am învățat să transform fiecare problemă într-o provocare.
      Cu curiozitate și oameni care m-au susținut, am găsit soluții pentru fiecare.
    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
      De la pasiunea pentru fotografie și film la creator de conținut.
    </p>

    <!-- Social links -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@dorulian" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-gray-400 hover:text-red-400 hover:border-red-500/30 hover:bg-red-500/10 transition-all duration-300 text-sm font-medium">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
        </svg>
        YouTube
      </a>
      <a href="https://dorulian.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-gray-400 hover:text-orange-400 hover:border-orange-500/30 hover:bg-orange-500/10 transition-all duration-300 text-sm font-medium">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M22.539 8.242H1.46V5.406h21.08v2.836zM1.46 10.812V24L12 18.11 22.54 24V10.812H1.46zM22.54 0H1.46v2.836h21.08V0z"/>
        </svg>
        Substack
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Dorusto" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 text-sm font-medium">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/>
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Majordom bio -->
    <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
      În timpul liber, construiesc un asistent personal numit <span class="text-white font-semibold">Majordom</span> care lucrează pentru mine, nu pentru corporații.
    </p>

    <!-- Butoane -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full">
      <a
        href="https://majordom.dorustoica.ro"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 hover:bg-emerald-500/10 hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all duration-300 text-left"
      >
        <div class="text-emerald-400 font-medium text-sm flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          🏛️ Filozofia Majordom
        </div>
        <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Proiectul la care lucrez în public</div>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://cal.com/dorulian"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/30 transition-all duration-300 text-left"
      >
        <div class="text-gray-300 font-medium text-sm flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
          📅 Rezervă o sesiune
        </div>
        <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Căutăm împreună soluția la provocarea ta</div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Substack -->
    <p class="text-emerald-400 font-medium tracking-wide text-sm">Intră în culise</p>
    <div class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-2">
      <iframe
        src="https://dorulian.substack.com/embed"
        width="100%"
        height="160"
        style="border:none; background:transparent !important;"
        frameborder="0"
        scrolling="no"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer class="mt-16 text-gray-600 text-xs flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
    <a href="https://ko-fi.com/dorulian" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-gray-400 transition-colors">☕ Susține-mă cu o cafea</a>
    <span>© 2026 Doru Stoica</span>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
